Using C45’s reduction, I constructed a quasi-local unitary with leakage \(\varepsilon_*\) exponentially small in \(1/\lambda\). I also proved a rooted-cell low-energy spectral error
\[
|\Delta E_i-\Delta E_i^{\mathrm{eff}}|
